{"id":"b66c5788afda7d6d","group":"89","path":"89/89-ex-henkin-sentence-modal.md","title":"Truth as the Explicit Henkin Fixed Point","display":"ex-henkin-sentence-modal — Truth as the Explicit Henkin Fixed Point","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-ex-henkin-sentence-modal","aliases":["89-ex-henkin-sentence-modal"],"display":"ex-henkin-sentence-modal — Truth as the Explicit Henkin Fixed Point","depends_on":["[[89-df-henkin-sentence-modal]]","[[89-lem-fixed-point-uniqueness]]","[[89-df-gl-logic]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-ex-henkin-sentence-modal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-ex-henkin-sentence-modal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-henkin-sentence-modal — Truth as the Explicit Henkin Fixed Point"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"728ff257684515d2\" href=\"?note=728ff257684515d2\" title=\"89-df-henkin-sentence-modal\">89-df-henkin-sentence-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"03089c3cefed4872\" href=\"?note=03089c3cefed4872\" title=\"89-lem-fixed-point-uniqueness\">89-lem-fixed-point-uniqueness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H_{\\Box,p}\">\\(\\mathcal H_{\\Box,p}\\)</span> 为 Henkin 不动点类，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> 为定理集。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}henkin\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}modal}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\top\\in\\mathcal H_{\\Box,p},\\\\\n&amp;\\forall H\\in\\mathcal H_{\\Box,p}\\;\n\\bigl((H\\leftrightarrow\\Box H)\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\land(H\\leftrightarrow\\top)\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\land H\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}henkin\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}modal}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\top\\in\\mathcal H_{\\Box,p},\\\\\n&amp;\\forall H\\in\\mathcal H_{\\Box,p}\\;\n\\bigl((H\\leftrightarrow\\Box H)\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\land(H\\leftrightarrow\\top)\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\land H\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 105；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top\">\\(\\top\\)</span> 是命题定理，必然化给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\\top\">\\(\\Box\\top\\)</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\top\\leftrightarrow\\Box\\top)\\in\\mathrm{GL}\">\\((\\top\\leftrightarrow\\Box\\top)\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span>，且它不含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>。这证明具体成员存在。任意成员的自可证等价由定义，与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top\">\\(\\top\\)</span> 的等价由唯一性，最后用命题推理得它是定理。原有“自身可证”等价完整保留，新增的存在见证不依赖一般存在性定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-henkin-sentence-modal","status":"resolved","id":"728ff257684515d2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-henkin-sentence-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-fixed-point-uniqueness","status":"resolved","id":"03089c3cefed4872","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-fixed-point-uniqueness]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal H_{\\Box,p}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}henkin\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}modal}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\top\\in\\mathcal H_{\\Box,p},\\\\\n&\\forall H\\in\\mathcal H_{\\Box,p}\\;\n\\bigl((H\\leftrightarrow\\Box H)\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\land(H\\leftrightarrow\\top)\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\land H\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\top","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box\\top","display":false},{"tex":"(\\top\\leftrightarrow\\Box\\top)\\in\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\top","display":false}],"bytes":1324,"backlinks":[{"id":"728ff257684515d2","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"成员 $H$ 不含被消去的 $p$，且 $(H\\leftrightarrow\\Box H)\\in\\mathrm{GL}$。$p$ 现在是显式类参数，旧记号只能在已固定 $p$ 时引用。此处给类定义，不预设成员已经存在。$\\Box p$ 模态化，故弱条件与原书加强条件等价。\n算术实现下得到 $H^*$ 与自身可证性之间的可证等价。进一步的可证性来自 Löb 规则，见 [[89-cor-henkin-provable]]；具体代表为 $\\top$，见 [[89-ex-henkin-sentence-modal]]。"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-111","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"例子与边界：[[89-ex-fixed-point-computation]]、[[89-ex-fixed-point-degree-increase]]、[[89-prop-nonmodalized-fixed-points]]、[[89-ex-fixed-point-table-erratum]]、[[89-ex-godel-sentence-modal]]、[[89-ex-henkin-sentence-modal]]。练习展开：[[89-lem-fixed-point-valuation]]、[[89-thm-double-fixed-point]]。"}],"outgoing":["728ff257684515d2","03089c3cefed4872","0006800fa1c85177"]}